# Docker context hygiene: gitignored build state must not ride local
# builds — _build/deps bloat the context, priv/plts (a dialyzer PLT,
# hundreds of MB) would land in the release image via `COPY priv priv`
# (review finding; CI checkouts are clean but operator builds aren't).
_build/
deps/
priv/plts/
cover/
erl_crash.dump
